	(text "PWR_FLAGs: the bus supplies VCC and GND." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 55.88 107.95 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "9a1716b5-3bbd-58a1-9cbb-215f0d6ba180"))
	(text "SIX 36-PIN SLOTS, EVERY PIN BUSSED (X1, THE POWER CONNECTOR, IS NOT WIRED)" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "899d1b94-f627-5c0a-883e-496f6e3cac4c"))
	(text "Every slot carries the same 36 lines, pin for pin: -EF1, -EF2, -EF3, then the 30-pin System-5 bus (VCC, D0-D7, Q,\nTPA, TPB, -MRD, -MRW, A0-A7, -INT, N2, -EF, -VMA, -RESET, N1, N0, GND), then -INP, -OUT and EXP. A 30-pin card\nplugs into the middle 30: pins 1-30 are the System-5 bus pin for pin, 31-33 = -EF1-3, 34-36 = -INP, -OUT, EXP.\nX1 (power) is on no net in the drawing; on the copper its pin 2 touches GND and pin 1 nothing (the +5V track stops short)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "40bcb8a8-a11d-582a-82bd-0b86febf2a0f"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
